# Environment variables — block every variant so a stray `.env`,
# `.env.production`, or editor-renamed copy can't be committed by
# accident. The only env file allowed in the repo is `.env.example`,
# which contains placeholder values and is whitelisted below.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

